John Kewley (jk@cs.man.ac.uk) wrote:
: Is it not time there was a Dwarf class around? Someone must have done one.
: How come the green fairy types get to play in hack, yet real men have to be
: full size (Barbarian).

: Seriously, what do people think of a dwarf class?

I think it would be great.  Some intrinsics:
infravision (I know you would have to CREATE it first)
identify all gems
better ability with a pick-axe
lower charisma (except to other dwarves)
poison resistance/limited magic resistance
good STR/CON bad DEX

Would start out with dwarvish armor, some times a pick-axe, some gems and one
of the several types of dwarvish weapons.

I guess would have some similar abilities to an Archeologist, but then
again so do a Cave-Man and Barbarian

But wizard mode would have to become a different letter.  Oh well, the
price of progress :-)
